        165
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0069",
      "sentenceId": "c14-s03-p165-04650-s009",
      "sentenceText": "New York, for instance, is where “there’s nothing you can’t do…these streets will make you feel brand-new, big lights will inspire you,” according to Jay-Z and Alicia Keys in “Empire State of Mind.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "47c6e6fd46a10056337bdf54f8595511edbbf8928e30047ccbd744b16b6b43fe",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-s03-p165-04650-r009-010",
